CM Three-wire inverted V for 20 m: a short feed wire at the apex, two drooping legs.
CM Leaf constants (knobs): gap, length_factor, angle.  The rest follow from them.
CE
SY gap=0.2           ' Feed-wire length at the apex (m)
SY length_factor=0.96 ' Each leg as a fraction of a quarter wave
SY angle=30          ' Leg droop below horizontal (degrees)
SY leg=length_factor*299.792458/14.2/4-gap/2  ' Leg length (m)
SY dy=leg*cos(angle), dz=leg*sin(angle)       ' 4nec2 trig is in degrees
GW 1 1  0 -gap/2 12  0 gap/2 12  0.001
GW 2 25 0 gap/2 12  0 gap/2+dy 12-dz  0.001
GW 3 25 0 -gap/2 12  0 -gap/2-dy 12-dz  0.001
GE 1
GN 2 0 0 0 13 0.005
EX 0 1 1 0 1 0
FR 0 1 0 0 14.2 0
EN
